<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #222;">
    <p style="font-size: 1.2em;"><strong>⚠️ Panic alert</strong></p>
    <p>Hi {{ contact_name }},</p>
    <p>
      <strong>{{ user_name }}</strong> ({{ user_phone }}) triggered a panic
      alert on PanicSwitch at {{ timestamp }}. You are one of their confirmed
      emergency contacts.
    </p>
    <p>Last reported location:</p>
    <p><a href="{{ map_url }}">View on the map ({{ latitude }}, {{ longitude }})</a></p>
    <p>Please try to contact {{ user_name }} as soon as possible.</p>
  </body>
</html>
